          <p class="eyebrow">Who's behind this</p>
          <h2>Pascal Kozlowski</h2>
          <p>It all started with curiosity, with a server I wanted to understand rather than just use. The hobby turned into years of real practice, with stints at IT service providers and system houses and an own operation that has grown every year.</p>
          <p>For over ten years I've worked with Linux, servers and virtualization, at first for myself, now as what I do for a living. I'm currently completing that path formally: IHK degree as IT specialist for systems integration, expected December 2026.</p>
          <p>What interests me about this job is the part most people skip: that a system doesn't just run, but that someone can understand why it runs. That's why I document everything I touch, for you, and so that in an emergency someone else could take over.</p>
          <p class="plain-mail">You can reach me directly: Phone <a href="tel:+491628213267"><strong>+49 162 8213267</strong></a> · Email <a href="mailto:pk@kozlowski-it.de"><strong>pk@kozlowski-it.de</strong></a></p>
